// LLAMP-SPEC v1 | ADR-033
=adr: 033
=title: API Key M2M Auth — Middleware Fix + Frontend UI
=date: 2026-02-26
=status: accepted

#ctx
~gap1: auth.middleware.ts used ApiKey.findOne({prefix, isActive}) → returns arbitrary doc when multiple keys share prefix → compareKey() fails for all but one
~gap2: no frontend UI for API key management

#decision
=fix1: replace findOne with find+iteration in requireAuth + optionalAuth
  → fetch ALL active keys matching prefix → hash-compare each until match
=fix2: extend /profile page with API Keys section (table + create modal + one-time reveal panel)
~complexity: O(n) bcrypt comparisons, acceptable for n<20 keys per org
=no_new_routes: profile page only

#consequences
+pos: [multiple_keys_same_prefix_work, Node-RED_MQTT_can_auth_via_Bearer, single_credential_mgmt_page]
-neg: [O(n)_bcrypt_per_request, acceptable_at_POC_scale]
~key_format: iot_live_|iot_test_ prefix, bcrypt hash stored (ADR-002 pattern)

#scope
=arch_summary_update: yes
